        "//frameworks/opt/car/services/updatableServices",
        "//frameworks/opt/car/services/updatableServices/tests",
    ],

    compile_dex: true,

    installable: true,
}
FILE README.md
# System Service Facade

AAOS car-lib, CarService and test dependency closure with a cross-domain Binder facade wired into
ICarImpl. The complete product requires an AOSP tree and platform Soong dependencies.
